# docbook-xsl
### The DocBook XSL style sheets without namespace (docbook-xsl-nons), a tool of the build machine
### (lfs/docbook-xsl:native): the manual pages of lfs/systemd and lfs/polkit, the xmlto of
### lfs/xmlto:native. xsltproc --nonet finds them through the XML catalog of lfs/libxml2:native
PKG_VER=1.79.2
PKG_URL="https://github.com/docbook/xslt10-stylesheets/releases/download/release/${PKG_VER}/docbook-xsl-nons-${PKG_VER}.tar.bz2"
PKG_DEPS="lfs/libxml2:native lfs/docbook-xml:native"
BUILD_PROCESS=custom
